window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>We get what we want. What we want is her.</b><br><br>She’s the daughter of a mafia don. A princess who deserves better than what her father signed her up for—a loveless marriage to a cruel man.<br><br>My business partner and I have had her in our sights for much longer than she could ever know.<br><br>Now the time has come…<br><br>To claim her.<br><br><i>Fans of Faith Summers, BB Hamel and Michelle Heard will love the Brides and Billionaires series!</i><br><br><b><i>Billionaires with all the time on their hands to spend worshipping the woman they claim as their bride. If you love arranged marriage and action with your dark mafia romance, DECEPTIVE UNION is your next 1-CLICK. </i></b><br>"; 
